on-arrival: rosenfeld_dead = 1; n_advisors -= 1 if rosenfeld_advisor == 1; rosenfeld_advisor = 0
tags: event

JUMP IN THE URINAL
AND STAND ON YOUR HEAD.
I’M THE ONE THAT’S ALIVE.
YOU’RE ALL DEAD.